cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RailPulse"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency rail service reliability and graphic timetable workbench.
  Parses GTFS static archives locally and computes Marey time-distance
  stringlines, headway coefficient of variation, vehicle bunching rates, excess
  passenger wait time, and downstream delay propagation.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/railpulse"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/railpulse/"
keywords:
  - rail
  - gtfs
  - transit
  - timetable
  - reliability
  - stringline
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
authors:
